{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TOY5oPoO7s1794563369.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產西九龍南昌分行高級分行經理李子清表示，分行最新促成一宗深水埗愛海頌租賃成交，單位為1座中層D室，實用面積695平方呎，採三房套房連儲物房間隔，單位座向南方，享開揚都市景，最新以35000元租出，折合實用呎租50元。<br/>中原地產李子清指，上址業主於2024年4月以1098萬元買入單位，持貨2年半，是次租出單位可享3.8厘租金回報，回報十分理想。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:08.458010+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T02:44:25.526868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:30:56.327610+00:00","content_hash":"172f3aea41c46586ac59f283f13f939ef4bb7ca68d14ec8732b96187a12be40c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:08.458010+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}